# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output — generated by bootstrap.sh inside the repo.
#
# Both default to $DOTFILES_ROOT (bootstrap.sh:13-14), so a run on a fresh
# machine writes them here. backups/ holds files moved out of $HOME by
# backup_path, i.e. whatever the machine had before — never commit it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
backups/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / machine-local overrides
#
# .zshrc:19 sources ~/.config/zshrc/custom/*.zsh AFTER the numbered files,
# and that path is this repo through the symlink — so custom/ is the place
# to put one host's tokens and paths. Ignored, so it never gets committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
configs/zsh/.config/zshrc/custom/
*.local
.env
.env.*
*-secrets.sh
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor scratch
#
# configs/nvim/.config/nvim IS ~/.config/nvim through the symlink, so
# anything Neovim writes beside its config lands in this repo.
# lazy-lock.json is deliberately tracked — do not add it here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.netrwhist
spell/
tags
